# 設定 on SC0000 page 1, through the `option` steps (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-09-engine-shell-design.md, §8).
# Each `option` opens 設定 at its option's tab from that tab's menu command, sets one control and presses OK, so
# agerc_settings_apply and CALLBACK_SETTING.BIN run after each: natively AGERC's dialog 9 (TBM_SETPOS and the page's
# scroll notification for a trackbar, BM_CLICK for a check box), on the port the options panel. The game holds while
# 設定 is open and goes on from the page it held on.
#
# - `options` lists every option's value: first the sandbox's (Volume0=0 from the driver's quiet seed), last the ones
#   set here.
# - wheel-advance on writes message:AdvanceMesOnWheel=1, so a wheel-down at the text wait then advances.
# - 効果音 turns the SE route off live, and ｷｬﾝｾﾙ turns it back on (the dialog's own check box and button).
# - 動作環境 opens and cancels.
#
# Compare SYS4REG.INI after `close` on both targets: the message, sound and system keys set below, SE=1, and
# Volume0..3 written by each OK. Run on a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-settings-dialog.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 1.5
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=20
wait 1
click newgame.begin
wait-state top=SC0000@0x83f timeout=60  # page 1
settle

move adv.next
wheel down                              # AdvanceMesOnWheel=0: the wheel does not advance
wait 1
expect top=SC0000@0x83f

options                                 # the sandbox's values
dialogs                                 # none: options cancels 設定
option wheel-advance on
wait 1
expect top=SC0000@0x83f
wheel down                              # now the wheel advances
wait 1.5
expect top=SC0000@0x874                 # page 2

menu sound-settings
wait 1.5
shot settings-sound
answer 効果音(&S)                       # SE route off, live
wait 0.5
answer ｷｬﾝｾﾙ                            # SE back on
wait 2
dialogs                                 # none

option message-speed 40
option window-opacity 10
option auto-wait-voice 1500
option auto-wait-text 2500
option bgm-volume 6000
option voice-volume 8000
option lower-bgm-on-voice off
option lower-bgm-level 30
option effect-skip on
wait 1
options                                 # the values set above
expect top=SC0000@0x874

menu system-info
wait 2
shot settings-system
answer ｷｬﾝｾﾙ
wait 2
dialogs                                 # none
expect top=SC0000@0x874
advance                                 # the game goes on at message speed 40
expect top=SC0000@0x8a9                 # page 3
